+"""Bounded inert Word 97-2007 binary (.doc) main-story text reader.
+
+CFB allocation checks are copied and specialized from the accepted XLS reader;
+no XLS/PPT profile boundaries are changed. Only FIB/CLX text is interpreted.
+Macro/storage, object, field and encrypted documents refuse. No file, process,
+network, Office or formula execution. See package FORMAT-NOTES.md for the exact
+subset and Microsoft specification references.
